"><br/>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.partner_type == 'customer' and object.payment_type "
"== 'outbound'\">We have processed your refund of</t>\n"
"        <t t-elif=\"object.partner_type == 'supplier' and object."
"payment_type == 'outbound'\">We have processed your payment of</t>\n"
"        <t t-elif=\"object.partner_type == 'supplier' and object."
"payment_type == 'inbound'\">Thank you for your refund of</t>\n"
"        <t t-else=\"\">Thank you for your payment of</t> <span style=\"font-"
"weight:bold;\" t-out=\"format_amount(object.amount, object.currency_id) or "
"''\">$ 10.00</span>.\n"
"        Please find the <t t-out=\"object.payment_receipt_title."
"lower()\">payment receipt</t> <span t-if=\"object.name\" style=\"font-weight:"
